      "content": "`renderCommands(runContext, taskCommands)` is now invoked here for the debug log and again in `configure()` via `withCmd(this.renderCommands(...))`. Since `renderCommands` performs internal-storage replacement and full re-rendering (including re-assembling interpreter+beforeCommands+commands), this duplicates non-trivial work and, worse, may produce different values between the log line and the actual container command if rendering is non-deterministic (e.g. new temp file paths for internal storage). Render once and reuse the result for both the debug log and `configure()`."
    },
    {
      "path": "script/src/main/java/io/kestra/plugin/scripts/exec/scripts/runners/CommandsWrapper.java",
      "start_line": 168,
